  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large paella pan or skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and tomato, and cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, saffron, and chicken broth, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the rice and bring to a boil.",
